<v Sean>And then you move on to another game, at least for me.

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:21.540
<v Sean>I know that probably you guys and our target audience would have spent more time at the arcade machine than me.

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:26.680
<v Sean>So I just had no idea that this was, this had more stuff.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:28.960
<v Joe>Well, I'm probably coming in.

