<v Joe>I'm sure I played this in the arcade because it's kind of just ubiquitous.

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:40.260
<v Joe>But like I feel like I don't really remember it so much in the arcade, but I did play this as a kid.

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:51.140
<v Joe>I think the first TMNT and then the one that I actually liked, which I thought was maybe this one that we still didn't get to was it was the one where the second level is the surfing level.

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:52.720
<v Joe>I used to love that. It's not this one.

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:55.260
