00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:57.460
<v Joe>Yeah, you make a good point that I hadn't really thought of until right now.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:05.400
<v Joe>But the fact that it's pretty rare for an NES game to have a pixel art that is so one to one to its source.

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:14.780
