00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:32.900
<v Sean>Yeah. And when they try, it ends up looking kind of awful.

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:45.040
<v Joe>Yeah. I mean, maybe TMNT is just like, especially that 80s TMNT is just like the perfect level of like not realistic looking enough, cartoony enough that you can kind of make it out of a few pixels as well.

